@startuml
!pragma layout elk
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam margin 10
left to right direction

[*] --> Draft
Draft --> Checking : request start
Checking --> Ready : checks pass
Checking --> Draft : check fails
Ready --> Recording : start clock
Recording --> Degraded : stream stale
Degraded --> Recording : stream replayed
Recording --> Paused : pause
Paused --> Recording : resume
Recording --> Closing : stop
Degraded --> Closing : stop
Paused --> Closing : stop
Closing --> Review : flush and summarise
Review --> Finalised : confirm and export
Finalised --> [*]
@enduml
